( F4 T1 / K10: corpus ground1 with a groundflow_velocity target.
  Two quad4 elements, permeability 0.1, pres 1 prescribed at the bottom
  and 0 at the top: the middle node gets pres 0.5.
  No limit record: default limit 0, the total pressure is capped to 0 and reaches the limit at every integration point, so the groundflow velocity is 0, as in the Professional 02-08-2026, AUDIT K10. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
groundflow_velocity
groundflow_pressure
end_initia
node 1  0 0
node 2  1 0
node 3  0 1
node 4  1 1
node 5  0 2
node 6  1 2
element 1  -quad4 1 2 3 4
element 2  -quad4 3 4 5 6
bounda_dof 0  -ra 1 2 -ra -pres
bounda_time    0  0.0 0.0 1. 1. 100. 1.
bounda_dof 1  -ra 5 6 -ra -pres
bounda_time    1  0.0 0.0 100.0 0.
group_type 0  -groundflow
group_groundflow_permeability 0  0.1 0.1

post_calcul -groundflow_pressure -total_pressure
control_timestep  0  1. 1.
target_item 0   -node_dof 3 -pres
target_value   0   0.5 1.e-4
target_item 1   -node_dof 3 -gvely
target_value   1   0. 1.e-6
end_data
